{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "https://quancrypt.local/schemas/topology.schema.json",
  "title": "topology",
  "description": "analyzer-service'in statik analizle \u00e7\u0131kard\u0131\u011f\u0131 servis topolojisi (P3.1, P3.4). D\u00fc\u011f\u00fcmler projenin par\u00e7alar\u0131 ve konu\u015ftu\u011fu d\u0131\u015f u\u00e7lard\u0131r; kenarlar ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 kuran taraftan (istemci) dinleyene (sunucu) do\u011frudur. Statik analiz pazarl\u0131k edilen TLS s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fc ve anahtar de\u011fi\u015fim grubunu \u00f6l\u00e7emez; kenardaki `key_exchange` yaln\u0131zca \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131md\u0131r (`inferred`, `confidence` < 1) ve kenar `findings` ile kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 kripto bulgular\u0131n\u0131 do\u011fal anahtar\u0131yla g\u00f6sterir (D-208). `kind` listesi D-170'tir; core-service'e iletirken `EXTERNAL` \u2192 `EXTERNAL_CLIENT` e\u015flenir ve `DATABASE` d\u00fc\u011f\u00fcmleri iletilmez.",
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "nodes": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 200,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/node"
      }
    },
    "edges": {
      "type": "array",
      "maxItems": 1000,
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/edge"
      }
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "nodes",
    "edges"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "$defs": {
    "nodeId": {
      "type": "string",
      "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,200}$"
    },
    "node": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/nodeId"
        },
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 200,
          "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u00ad\\u061c\\u180e\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028-\\u202e\\u2060-\\u206f\\ufeff\\ufff9-\\ufffb]+$"
        },
        "kind": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "SERVICE",
            "GATEWAY",
            "BROKER",
            "DEVICE",
            "DATABASE",
            "EXTERNAL"
          ]
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 100,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
          }
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "name",
        "kind",
        "evidence"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "edge": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "source": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/nodeId"
        },
        "target": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/nodeId"
        },
        "protocol": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "HTTP",
            "GRPC",
            "MQTT",
            "AMQP",
            "KAFKA",
            "OTHER"
          ]
        },
        "tls": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "mtls": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "evidence": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 100,
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/evidence"
          }
        },
        "findings": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 500,
          "description": "Kenar\u0131n kulland\u0131\u011f\u0131 kripto bulgular\u0131; bulgu, core-service'in `uq_finding_location` anahtar\u0131yla g\u00f6sterilir (kimlik analizcide yoktur, agent core kimli\u011fine e\u015fler; D-208).",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/findingRef"
          }
        },
        "key_exchange": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/keyExchange"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source",
        "target",
        "protocol",
        "tls",
        "mtls",
        "evidence"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "evidence": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "D\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fc veya kenar\u0131 g\u00f6steren dosya ve sat\u0131r aral\u0131\u011f\u0131.",
      "properties": {
        "file": {
          "type": "string",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1024,
          "pattern": "^(?![A-Za-z]:)(?![/\\\\])(?!.*//)(?!(.*/)?\\.{1,2}(/|$))(?!.*/$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u00ad\\u061c\\u180e\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028-\\u202e\\u2060-\\u206f\\ufeff\\ufff9-\\ufffb\\\\]+$"
        },
        "line_start": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "line_end": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1
        },
        "location_kind": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "CODE",
            "CONFIG",
            "CERTIFICATE_FILE",
            "KEYSTORE_FILE",
            "BUILD_FILE",
            "TEST_CODE"
          ]
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "file",
        "line_start",
        "line_end",
        "location_kind"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "findingRef": {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "file": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Analiz k\u00f6k\u00fcne g\u00f6re g\u00f6reli yol, `/` ayra\u00e7l\u0131. Mutlak yol ve `..` b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc yoktur.",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 1024,
          "pattern": "^(?![A-Za-z]:)(?![/\\\\])(?!.*//)(?!(.*/)?\\.{1,2}(/|$))(?!.*/$)[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u00ad\\u061c\\u180e\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028-\\u202e\\u2060-\\u206f\\ufeff\\ufff9-\\ufffb\\\\]+$"
        },
        "symbol": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "Kodda `S\u0131n\u0131f#metot`, yap\u0131land\u0131rmada anahtar, sertifika ve anahtar dosyalar\u0131nda dosya ad\u0131 (D-171).",
          "minLength": 1,
          "maxLength": 512,
          "pattern": "^[^\\u0000-\\u001f\\u007f-\\u009f\\u00ad\\u061c\\u180e\\u200b-\\u200f\\u2028-\\u202e\\u2060-\\u206f\\ufeff\\ufff9-\\ufffb]+$"
        },
        "algorithm_family": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "RSA",
            "ECDSA",
            "ECDH",
            "EDDSA",
            "DH",
            "DSA",
            "ML_KEM",
            "ML_DSA",
            "SLH_DSA",
            "AES",
            "DES",
            "TRIPLE_DES",
            "CHACHA20",
            "SHA1",
            "SHA2",
            "SHA3",
            "MD5",
            "HMAC",
            "X25519",
            "HYBRID_X25519_MLKEM768",
            "UNKNOWN"
          ]
        },
        "usage_context": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "TLS_KEY_EXCHANGE",
            "TLS_SERVER_AUTH",
            "MTLS_CLIENT_AUTH",
            "CERTIFICATE",
            "ENCRYPTION",
            "KEY_WRAP",
            "SIGNATURE",
            "TOKEN_SIGNATURE",
            "KEY_AGREEMENT",
            "HASH",
            "SYMMETRIC_ENCRYPTION",
            "KEYSTORE",
            "UNKNOWN"
          ]
        },
        "line_start": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "description": "Bulgunun ilk sat\u0131r\u0131; b\u00fct\u00fcn dosyaya ait bulgularda (sertifika, keystore) null."
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "file",
        "symbol",
        "algorithm_family",
        "usage_context",
        "line_start"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    },
    "keyExchange": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "Kenarda kullan\u0131lan TLS anahtar de\u011fi\u015fiminin statik \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131m\u0131 (D-208, D-213): kod ve yap\u0131land\u0131rma grup belirtmiyorsa projenin Java s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fcn varsay\u0131lan gruplar\u0131d\u0131r, bu y\u00fczden `inferred` true ve `confidence` 1'den k\u00fc\u00e7\u00fckt\u00fcr. Pazarl\u0131k edilen grup yaln\u0131z el s\u0131k\u0131\u015fma testiyle \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcl\u00fcr (Faz 8).",
      "properties": {
        "group_family": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "CLASSICAL",
            "HYBRID"
          ]
        },
        "groups": {
          "type": "array",
          "maxItems": 20,
          "items": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,32}$"
          },
          "description": "\u0130stemci taraf\u0131n Java s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fcn varsay\u0131lan gruplar\u0131 (tercih s\u0131ras\u0131yla) ya da kod ve yap\u0131land\u0131rman\u0131n adland\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131 gruplar; s\u0131ras\u0131 kaynakla do\u011frulanmad\u0131ysa bo\u015f (D-213)."
        },
        "inferred": {
          "type": "boolean"
        },
        "confidence": {
          "type": "number",
          "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
          "maximum": 1
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "group_family",
        "groups",
        "inferred",
        "confidence"
      ],
      "additionalProperties": false
    }
  }
}
